    ],
    "block_content": "For $\\sigma \\in \\{-1,1\\}$ let $\\eta_\\sigma$ and $f_\\sigma$ be the regression function and Bayes classifier for $Q_\\sigma$, respectively. Then"
   },
   {
    "block_id": 2,
    "block_label": "display_formula",
    "block_bbox": [
     331,
     254,
     886,
     419
    ],
    "block_content": " $$ \\begin{align*}\\bar{\\rho}(\\Pi_{1},\\Pi_{-1})&=\\mathcal{E}_{Q_{1}}(f_{-1})\\\\&=2\\mathbb{E}_{Q_{1,X}}\\Big[\\big|\\eta_{Q}^{\\sigma}(X)-1/2\\big|\\mathbb{1}\\{f_{1}(X)\\neq f_{-1}(X)\\}\\Big]\\\\&\\geq4c_{Q} n_{Q}^{-1/2}r_{1}\\\\&\\geq c^{\\prime}n_{Q}^{-\\frac{1+\\alpha}{2}}=2s.\\end{align*} $$ "
   },
   {
    "block_id": 3,
    "block_label": "text",
    "block_bbox": [
     209,
     435,
     837,
     461
    ],
    "block_content": "We refer to lemma C.4 in supplement to get the following bound"
   },
   {
    "block_id": 4,
    "block_label": "display_formula",
    "block_bbox": [
     331,
     476,
     886,
     778
    ],
    "block_content": " $$ \\begin{align*}KL(\\Pi_{1}||\\Pi_{-1})&\\leq n_{Q}KL(U_{Q}^{(1)}||U_{Q}^{(-1)})\\\\&\\leq n_{Q}(1/2+c_{Q}n_{Q}^{-1/2})\\log\\left(\\frac{1/2+c_{Q}n_{Q}^{-1/2}}{1/2-c_{Q}n_{Q}^{-1/2}}\\right)\\\\&\\quad+(1/2-c_{Q}n_{Q}^{-1/2})\\log\\left(\\frac{1/2-c_{Q}n_{Q}^{-1/2}}{1/2+c_{Q}n_{Q}^{-1/2}}\\right)\\\\&\\leq n_{Q}\\frac{2}{4}3c_{Q}^{2}n_{Q}^{-1}\\\\&\\leq c_{Q}^{2}\\end{align*} $$ "
   },
   {
    "block_id": 5,
    "block_label": "text",
    "block_bbox": [
     174,
     791,
     434,
     818
    ],
    "block_content": "where  $ U_{Q}^{\\sigma} \\sim \\mathrm{Bernoulli}(\\pi_{Q}^{\\sigma}) $."
   },
   {
    "block_id": 6,
