     1113
    ],
    "block_content": " $$ \\begin{align*}\\sup_{(P,Q)\\in\\Pi}\\mathbb{E}\\big[\\mathcal{E}_{Q}(\\widehat{f})\\big]&\\geq c n_{Q}^{-\\frac{1+\\alpha}{2}}\\vee c\\big(\\epsilon_{P} n_{P}\\big)^{-\\frac{\\beta(1+\\alpha)}{2\\beta+d}}\\\\&\\geq c^{\\prime}\\left(\\big(\\epsilon_{P} n_{P}\\big)^{-\\frac{\\beta}{2\\beta+d}}+n_{Q}^{-1/2}\\right)^{1+\\alpha}.\\end{align*} $$ "
